# Rendered Quarto reports live in an `html-reports/` folder beside the sources
# they come from (see _quarto.yml + quarto-post-render.sh) and are committed
# ad-hoc via git-LFS: they are large, self-contained HTML with base64-embedded
# figures. Requires `git lfs install` on the machine that commits them.
**/html-reports/**/*.html filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
**/html-reports/**/*.png filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
2026-05-ssp-ch/**/*.png filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
